WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.151
A parameter lets a function take an input.

2
00:00:04.923 --> 00:00:09.823
size is a placeholder. The function uses whatever value it is given.

3
00:00:10.699 --> 00:00:15.624
Calling square with 30 puts thirty into size. Ninety puts in ninety.

4
